Folio plugins
=============

Plugins add to Folio. Put each one (a folder) in here, or in
<Choices$Write>.Folio.Plugins, where it stays when you put in a newer
!Folio. Folio looks for them when it starts, so quit Folio and run it again
after adding one.

Speech
  FolioSpeech-<version>.zip: drag the !Folio in it over this one, which puts
  its Speech folder here. It lets Folio read
  documents aloud with a natural-sounding voice: a speaker button appears on
  the toolbar, and Read aloud, Speak selection and Reading speed on the
  document's menu. See Speech.ReadMe.

OCR
  FolioOCR-<version>.zip: drag the !Folio in it over this one, which puts
  its OCR folder here. It lets Folio read the text in scanned pages, so it
  can be found, selected, copied and read aloud: a Text recognition entry
  appears on the document's menu. See OCR.ReadMe.
